dreds of billions discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson; Washington: George Stephanopoulos)  The reaction of members of Congress to the meeting with the financial experts led by Federal Reserve Board chairman Ben Bernanke, the prospects for a stimulus package in the plan and how quickly the plan can get done discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Paulson's appearance on \"This Week\" this Sunday previewed.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Report introduced.  \n\n(New York: David Muir)  The reaction of economists and the average man on the street to the government stepping in to help the financial institutions examined.  [Brookings Inst. Douglas ELMENDORF&#134;- says the alternative is a financial system meltdown.]  [On the street, MAN&nbsp- says we are bankrupting the nation.]  [Columbia University professor Joseph STIGLITZ&#134;- talks about safety nets for corporations.] ", "segment_duration": 480, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 904995, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "5ln5yTcXQS", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-19", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 904994, "segment_id": "wEroZI2fCj", "segment_broadcast_id": "5ln5yTcXQS", "segment_title": "China / Tainted Milk", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Report introduced.   (Beijing: Stephanie Sy)  The extent of the contamination of milk supplies in China with the industrial chemical Melamine updated; details given about exemptions from daily inspections for some companies, the recent string of product safety scares and the views of the average Chinese to the crisis. ", "segment_dura